Cell["\<\
The weight goes to the lower branch so the total SBC is twice the \
displacement of the main band. Confirmed also by the plot\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.997849076393173*^9, 3.997849121093382*^9}, {
  3.997851556899764*^9, 
